@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About Us - SeleniumEduApp</PageTitle>

<div class="container mt-5 mb-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-md-9">
            <h1 class="display-4">About SeleniumEduApp</h1>
            <p class="lead text-muted">Empowering Automation Engineers with C# and Selenium expertise through AI-powered learning tools.</p>
            <hr />
            
            <h4 class="mt-4">Our Mission</h4>
            <p>SeleniumEduApp was created to bridge the gap between theoretical knowledge and practical implementation of Selenium Automation using C#. We believe that every aspiring QA engineer deserves access to high-quality, interactive learning resources — regardless of their financial background.</p>
            
            <p>Our mission is to make automation testing education accessible, practical, and effective by leveraging artificial intelligence to provide personalized learning experiences.</p>

            <h4 class="mt-4">Who We Are</h4>
            <p>We are a team of experienced QA automation engineers and software developers passionate about education and testing excellence. With combined experience of over 10 years in enterprise automation testing, we understand the challenges that beginners and intermediate testers face in mastering Selenium with C#.</p>

            <h4 class="mt-4">What We Offer</h4>
            <div class="row g-3 mt-2">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card border-0 bg-light h-100 p-3">
                        <h6 class="fw-bold">📚 Structured Learning Roadmap</h6>
                        <p class="small text-muted mb-0">From C# fundamentals to advanced Selenium Grid and Docker — a complete curriculum designed for progressive skill building.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card border-0 bg-light h-100 p-3">
                        <h6 class="fw-bold">🐛 AI Debug Bot</h6>
                        <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Instant AI-powered debugging for common Selenium exceptions. Paste your code and get step-by-step solutions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card border-0 bg-light h-100 p-3">
                        <h6 class="fw-bold">🎤 Mock Interview Practice</h6>
                        <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Practice real QA automation interview questions with AI-powered feedback on your answers.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card border-0 bg-light h-100 p-3">
                        <h6 class="fw-bold">💼 Real-World Projects</h6>
                        <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Hands-on automation projects that mirror real enterprise testing scenarios and framework designs.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h4 class="mt-4">Our Approach</h4>
            <p>Unlike traditional tutorial websites that provide static content, SeleniumEduApp uses AI technology to create an interactive learning experience. Our platform adapts to your learning pace and provides instant feedback — much like having a personal tutor available 24/7.</p>
            
            <ul>
                <li><b>Practice-First Learning:</b> Every concept comes with production-ready code examples you can immediately use.</li>
                <li><b>Error-Driven Pedagogy:</b> Learn by understanding and fixing real-world exceptions.</li>
                <li><b>Interview Readiness:</b> Prepare for SDET and QA Engineer roles with AI-evaluated mock interviews.</li>
                <li><b>Community-Driven:</b> Content is regularly updated based on industry trends and user feedback.</li>
            </ul>

            <h4 class="mt-4">Our Achievements</h4>
            <div class="row g-3 mt-2 text-center">
                <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
